<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 6.63 to 641.22.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.13.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 369 to 204.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,240,720 compared with 20,153,690 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
